The 4 file-type glyphs in index.tsx (TypeScript, JavaScript, React .tsx,
React .jsx) are traced from the Material Icon Theme icon set, used under MIT.

Source: https://github.com/material-extensions/vscode-material-icon-theme
Icons:  icons/typescript.svg, icons/javascript.svg, icons/react.svg, icons/react_ts.svg

